            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-red-500 font-black">&bull;</span>
              Buying based on overall star rating instead of matching the
              category to your actual space and goals.
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-red-500 font-black">&bull;</span>
              Skipping doorway and floor-space measurements before delivery
