      <!-- Common Mistakes -->
      <div class="mt-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">Common Mistakes Buyers Make</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">A category winner is only the right machine if the category matches your situation. These are the four ways that goes wrong.</p>
        <div class="space-y-6 my-8">
          <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Buying by overall star rating</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">The highest-rated machine in this guide is the best in its category, not the best for your room, budget, and training. Pick the category first, then the winner inside it.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Skipping the tape measure</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">Doorways, ceiling height at incline, and folded footprint account for most of the returns we hear about. Measure all three before ordering, not after delivery is booked.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Paying for capability you will not use</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">Steep incline ranges, 32-inch screens, and 4.0 CHP motors are real features with real prices. If your training will not touch them, they are cost rather than value.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Ignoring the subscription in the total</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">iFit and JRNY machines renew annually. Compare shortlisted machines on three-year cost so the cheaper sticker price does not hide the more expensive machine.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
